<title>USA: Innovus Corp FY 1996 net, shr loss widen.</title>
<headline>Innovus Corp FY 1996 net, shr loss widen.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		   1995</p>
<p> Net operating revenue	     $597,567		$189,380</p>
<p> Operating loss		   (6,955,731)	   (3,727,458)</p>
<p> Total other expense		(835,415)		 (7,893)</p>
<p> Net loss			   (7,791,146)	   (3,735,351)</p>
<p> Net loss per common share	   (1.59)		  (0.98)</p>
<p>						 1996		   1995</p>
<p> Total current assets	    $1,161,735	    $2,466,060</p>
<p> Total assets			 3,343,176	     4,750,130</p>
<p> Total stockholder's equity     1,490,029	     3,553,885</p>
<p>Total liabilities and</p>
<p>  stockholder's equity	    3,343,176	     4,750,130</p>
<p>NOTES: About $1,032,000 of 1996 net loss and $0.21 of loss per share resulted from impact of FASB Statement No. 123 for warrants exercisable at market price.</p>
</text>
